d through the Mini App, campaign information, raid interactions, leaderboard activity, basic technical information and transaction references.</p><h2>2. Wallet Information</h2><p>Your public wallet address may be used to associate paid campaigns, Premium access, leaderboard participation and reward eligibility with your account. We do not request or store private keys, seed phrases or wallet recovery phrases.</p><h2>3. Telegram</h2><p>When you use the Telegram Mini App, Telegram may provide account and Mini App authentication information to support features such as leaderboard participation and campaign access.</p><h2>4. Cookies & Sessions</h2><p>RUGCIRCUS may use a secure authentication cookie to keep a verified wallet session active. Browser storage may also be used for non-sensitive convenience data.</p><h2>5. Analytics & Sponsored Offers</h2><p>Campaign views, button interactions and sponsored-offer activity may be recorded for analytics, reward calculations, fraud controls and service reporting. Advertising partners may have their own tracking technologies and policies.</p><h2>6. Data Sharing</h2><p>Information may be processed by infrastructure, blockchain, Telegram, wallet, analytics, advertising and other service providers where necessary to provide requested features.</p><h2>7. Security</h2><p>Reasonable technical measures are used to protect authentication and service data. No internet service can guarantee absolute security.</p><h2>8. Your Choices</h2><p>You may stop using the service and disconnect your wallet. Where applicable, contact us with privacy requests.</p><h2>9. Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions: <a href="https://wa.me/38162248575" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp +381 62 248 575</a>.</p></article></div></body></html>